Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: jgm240 <jgm240@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/jgm240/LintabOS
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, dislocker, ntfs-3g, fdisk, gdisk, dosfstools,
 e2fsprogs, rsync, polkitd, pkexec, minisign, dconf-cli, libnotify-bin, iio-sensor-proxy, fprintd, libpam-fprintd, fuse3,
 python3-pyudev, zenity, efibootmgr, apt, python3-hivex
Recommends: gnome-snapshot, libcamera-tools, grub-efi-amd64, flatpak, wl-clipboard, pipewire-bin | pulseaudio-utils
Description: LintabOS tablet integration, installer, BitLocker tools and updater
 The LintabOS-specific parts of the system: tuning for the Lenovo IdeaPad Duet 3 (screen rotation, on-screen
 keyboard, fingerprint and camera setup), the installer and dual-boot partitioner, the "Boot into Windows" GRUB
 entry, dislocker-based BitLocker tools, branding, and the updater that installs signed releases of this very
 package from https://github.com/jgm240/LintabOS.
